      "node_id": "kg_doc_1",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Donald Patrick \"Pat\" Conroy (October 26, 1945 – March 4, 2016) was an American author who wrote several acclaimed novels and memoirs. Two of his novels, \"The Prince of Tides\" and \"The Great Santini\", were made into Oscar-nominated films. He is recognized as a leading figure of late-20th century Southern literature.",
